 "summaries": [
  {
   "section": "Tire",
   "text": "All four tires have an adequate amount of remaining tread depth with an even wear pattern. The tires are sized 285/60R18 which is slightly different from the OEM recommended size of 275/55R20."
  },
  {
   "section": "Exterior",
   "text": "The vehicle's exterior was dusty during inspection, which can hide minor imperfections. However, there are still minor miscellaneous scratches around the vehicle most of them are too small to see in photos. The sliding sunroof is aftermarket and works well. The underside shows light surface rust. Headlights and tail lights were clear and free of cracks or other damage. The panel alignments appeared to be normal. The exterior lights were functional and working properly."
  },
  {
   "section": "Interior",
   "text": "There is light wear to the seats. The interior trim and carpet show normal wear. The TPMS light is illuminated on the dash. I did not notice any odd smells or signs the car was smoked in. There were also no signs of water leaks. The climate control system operated in all modes and blew the desired temperature. All the interior electronics appeared to operate as designed, including the infotainment system."
  },
  {
   "section": "Mechanical",
   "text": "The vehicle has some modifications, including aftermarket wheels, an exhaust system, a twin-turbo intake system, and a PCM/ECU performance plug-in system. The ECU/PCM performance control has not been mounted, with the wires and control left in the passenger's footwell. All accessible fluids are on level. It did not have any visible active fluid leaks at the time of inspection."
  },
  {
   "section": "Road Test",
   "text": "The vehicle starts up with no issues or unusual sounds. The steering alignment is straight, and engine and braking performance are good. The vehicle shifts through all gears with no issues. The brakes are firm with no pulsations or grinding. The OBD scan detected multiple codes in the system. Please see the pictures for more diagnosis."
  }
 ],
